# Questgen version control (stage 1, 15 Nov). Allow-list: ignore everything at the top level, then re-include
# only the small source-of-truth files. `git add -A` (tools/snapshot.py) can therefore never pick up a PDF, a DB
# backup, page images or the 1.2 GB work/ folder. Why each choice: RESUME.md "Version control".
/*
!/.gitignore
!/*.md
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/page_src/
!/tools/
# owner 14 Nov (Fix 2, "Ok we should run Fix 1 and 2"): questions.db as plain text, one file per paper (tools/export_db_text.py,
# written by tools/snapshot.py at every publish), so the database has a line-by-line history.
!/dbtext/

# site/: the built page, the vendored libraries, the published project/ copies and the small data files.
!/site/
/site/*
!/site/review.html
!/site/vendor/
!/site/project/
!/site/structure/
!/site/data/
/site/data/*
!/site/data/bank.json
!/site/data/dotpoints.json
!/site/data/progress.json
!/site/data/inventory.json
!/site/data/inventory_files.json
# Fix 1 (14 Nov): the split bank (index + one file per topic, tools/bank_split.py) and the asset-store manifest
!/site/data/bank/
!/site/data/assets.json
# owner 14 Nov: the Needs a check page-picture manifest (tools/check_pages.py); the packs themselves (data/check/) are not tracked
!/site/data/check_pages.json

# Never tracked, wherever they appear (src/ = 231 exam PDFs, 896 MB; work/ and archive/ are covered by /* above).
src/
work/
archive/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pdf
*.db
*.zip
*.bundle
